values ((select id from public.sections where slug = $c8058$subconsultas$c8058$), (select id from public.lessons where slug = $c8059$subconsultas-escalares-y-derivadas$c8059$), $c8060$sub-q06-interpretar-derivada$c8060$, $c8061$query_interpretation$c8061$, $c8062$intermediate$c8062$, $c8063$Tabla derivada$c8063$, $c8064$¿Qué devuelve esta consulta?$c8064$, $c8065$```sql
SELECT c.country, round(avg(p.pedidos), 2) AS pedidos_promedio
FROM (
  SELECT customer_id, count(*) AS pedidos
  FROM orders
  WHERE status = 'delivered'
  GROUP BY customer_id
) AS p
INNER JOIN customers AS c ON c.id = p.customer_id
GROUP BY c.country;
```$c8065$, $c8066$La subconsulta produce una fila por cliente con su conteo; la consulta externa promedia esos conteos por país. Los clientes sin pedidos entregados no existen en la tabla derivada.$c8066$, null, null, array[$c8067$subquery$c8067$,$c8068$group_by$c8068$]::text[], 70, true)
